{"kind":"text","seq":39,"text":"My best coaster this round scored **6.72 excitement** (intensity 10.01, nausea 5.81, similarity 0.44), up from 6.67 last round. It's last round's layout with 4 inversions (3 vertical loops and a corkscrew), plus a banked mid-course turn and two airtime bunny hops before the brakes.\n\n- **Bunny hops:** These gave the whole gain. Air time went from 34 to 40.\n- **Lower-intensity version:** Cutting the pre-loop booster from 24 to 22 kept the same 6.72 with intensity down to 9.81, but the banked result is the earlier 10.01 build.\n- **What didn't work:** Raising the final booster to 26 pushed intensity to 14.5 and dropped excitement to 2.02. Raising the first boosters from 25 to 27, or slowing the brakes from 10 to 4, changed almost nothing.\n- **Left unsolved:** Max lateral G stays at 2.9 in every version and I never found which piece causes it. Fixing that would free up intensity room for more speed next round."}
